But wait — ZTS400/ZTS401 appear as separate diagnostics with line/column, while ZTS500 is about the missing capsule. The ZTS500 suggestion explicitly lists the properties that hold and suggests `Proof<Response, "read_only" | ...>`. Notably it excludes no_secret_leakage and no_credential_leakage. So with that capsule, ZTS400/ZTS401 should be gone.

